sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant BFF
    participant ASR as ASR Mock / Real ASR

    Browser->>BFF: Connect /intelligentVoice/asr/stream?sampleRate&language
    BFF-->>Browser: WebSocket connected
    Browser->>BFF: Binary PCM chunks
    BFF->>ASR: Establish or reuse managed connection
    BFF->>ASR: Binary PCM chunks
    ASR-->>BFF: {code:0,data:{text,isFinal:false}}
    BFF-->>Browser: Normalized JSON response
    Browser->>BFF: {"action":"stop"}
    BFF->>ASR: {"action":"stop"}
    ASR-->>BFF: {code:0,data:{text,isFinal:true}}
    BFF-->>Browser: Final JSON response
    Note over Browser,BFF: WebSocket remains open
    Browser->>BFF: Binary PCM chunks for next Session
